    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A FIRST FLOOR 1 BED APARTMENT IN THE \"AN DOIRÍN\" DEVELOPMENT IN LOWER GREEN STREET, DINGLE. THE APARTMENT IS APPROXIMATELY 47.50 SQ.M. OR C. 510 SQ.FT. IN SIZE. THE DEVELOPMENT IS A GATED DEVELOPMENT OFF THE STREET AND WITH PRIVATE CAR PARKING ON A FIRST COME FIRST SERVED BASIS. \r\nTHE APARTMENT IS IDEAL FOR A COULE AND/OR AS HOLIDAY RETREAT IN ONE OF IRELAND'S MOST POPULAR DESTINATIONS."
      }
